year: 1906
attribution: Traditional British folk song ("O Waly, Waly", 18th century), collected and published by Cecil Sharp in Folk Songs from Somerset (1906, Sharp died 1924); melody and words are anonymous and public domain.
tags: ballad, folk, love, sea

